#: src/app/[lang]/blog/cloud-budgeting-privacy-risks/page.tsx:1187
msgid "Cloud budgeting apps solve a real problem, but they solve it in a way that creates new problems. The convenience of automatic transaction import, AI categorization, and cross-device sync comes at the cost of your financial privacy."
