msgid "Nothing happens to your data because Budgie does not have your data. Everything is stored locally on your device. If Budgie as a company ceased to exist, your app would continue to function with all your data intact. You can export data at any time in standard formats. There is no server to shut down, no migration to worry about, no acquisition that could change data handling. Your data remains yours permanently."
